WrapperToken::setSwapTargetToApproveTarget
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when isValid is true
    │   ├── it should store swapTarget metadata
    │   ├── it should emit SetSwapTargetToApproveTarget
    │   └── it should return stored approveTarget and isValid via swapTargetToApproveTarget
    └── when isValid is false
        ├── it should delete swapTarget metadata
        ├── it should emit SetSwapTargetToApproveTarget
        └── it should return zero approveTarget and false isValid via swapTargetToApproveTarget
